+# Async Runtime
+
+This project has no current recorded decision on an async runtime. No such choice is documented anywhere in the repository (README, CONTRIBUTING, CHANGELOG, or docs), and Gin is a Go HTTP framework that relies on goroutines rather than a pluggable async runtime, so nothing is recorded here to state.
